# A registry that is not the vocabulary it publishes.
#
# Three defects, and each is one a real edit could introduce: a declared code with no row at all,
# a row whose name does not belong to its number, and a row dated from a revision the registry
# does not have.
#
# registry-revision: 2
#
# code|name|half|reason|stage|reachability|case|since
1001|WrongMagic|core-result|MalformedEncoding|header|corpus|wrong-magic|1
1002|UnsupportedFormatVersionExtended|core-result|UnsupportedProfileFormatVersion|header|corpus|unsupported-format-version|1
1004|UnsupportedFeatureManifest|core-result|UnsupportedFeatureManifest|manifest|corpus|a-manifest-this-build-does-not-accept|3
